---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Devlogs | Agogpixel Studio"
  description="Follow Agogpixel Studio's engineering devlogs, mechanics breakdowns, and notes on building an independent studio in public."
>
  <div class="py-16 md:py-28">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <!-- Section Header -->
      <div class="mb-16 text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-brand-cyan/30 bg-cosmos-900/90 px-4 py-1.5 font-mono text-xs text-brand-cyan mb-4">
          <span class="inline-block h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-cyan animate-pulse"></span>
          <span>Engineering Hub</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-5xl font-sans">
          Building an "A-" Studio in Public
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-4 text-slate-300 text-base sm:text-lg font-sans">
          Transparent engineering logs, arcade mechanics deep dives, and production retrospectives.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Tasteful Coming Soon State -->
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-cosmos-800 bg-cosmos-900/60 p-8 md:p-12 shadow-xl backdrop-blur-sm text-center">
        <div class="mx-auto flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl border border-brand-amber/30 bg-cosmos-950 mb-6 shadow-lg shadow-brand-amber/10">
          <img src="/assets/rocket_guinea_pig.png" alt="Agogpixel Mascot" class="h-10 w-10 object-contain" />
        </div>

        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-brand-amber/30 bg-brand-amber/10 px-3.5 py-1 font-mono text-xs text-brand-amber mb-4">
          <span>Inaugural Entries In Preparation</span>
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white sm:text-3xl font-sans">
          Devlogs Launching Soon
        </h2>

        <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-300 font-sans">
          We're preparing comprehensive breakdowns of our game feel experiments, retro rendering pipelines, and lean production workflows. Check back as our active development sprints hit milestone releases.
        </p>

        <!-- Preview Topics Grid -->
        <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 font-mono text-xs text-left">
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-cosmos-800 bg-cosmos-950 p-4">
            <span class="text-brand-cyan font-bold block mb-1">Arcade Game Feel</span>
            <span class="text-slate-400">Tuning inertial drift curves, screenshake, and instant control feedback.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-cosmos-800 bg-cosmos-950 p-4">
            <span class="text-brand-amber font-bold block mb-1">Retro Physics Loops</span>
            <span class="text-slate-400">Fixed-rate physics simulation, collision fidelity, and sub-pixel snapping.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-cosmos-800 bg-cosmos-950 p-4">
            <span class="text-brand-scarlet font-bold block mb-1">The "A-" Standard</span>
            <span class="text-slate-400">Shipping velocity, avoiding feature bloat, and automated CI/CD pipelines.</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-10 border-t border-cosmos-800 pt-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono text-slate-500 gap-4">
          <span>Track: Building an A- Studio in Public</span>
          <a href="https://github.com/agogpixel" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-brand-cyan hover:underline">
            Follow Studio on GitHub ↗
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
